On another note:
POSSIBLE SPOILER!!!!!!!

















If you find yourself on the far side of the castle with no water
walking or levitation capabilities and wish to get back up a level,
you can dig your way out of the castle.  Go up to the outer wall and
dig until you hit the hard edge of the dungeon.  Stay along the
outside and continue to dig alongside the moat.  There won't be any
water there and you can pass safely from one end of the castle to the
other.  I only discovered this when I found myself in this situation.
Sorry if it seems obvious.

